00:16:39,220 --> 00:16:42,020
Codex's third capability: persistent memory.

373
00:16:42,230 --> 00:16:45,153
As mentioned in my Claude Code video,

374
00:16:45,153 --> 00:16:48,550
CC has a manual persistent memory, CLAUDE.md.

375
00:16:48,830 --> 00:16:50,555
and an automatic memory system,

376
00:16:50,555 --> 00:16:52,073
both of which store things

377
00:16:52,073 --> 00:16:54,409
