380
00:17:01,020 --> 00:17:03,038
and then, at the right moment,

381
00:17:03,038 --> 00:17:06,500
inject these memories into the Agent as context.

382
00:17:06,740 --> 00:17:10,699
Codex, similarly, has these two persistent memory systems.

383
00:17:10,950 --> 00:17:15,266
In Codex, manual persistent memory is AGENTS.md,

384
00:17:15,266 --> 00:17:17,612
plus an automatic memory.

385
00:17:17,612 --> 00:17:21,460
Let's open Settings, find Personalization.

386
00:17:21,868 --> 00:17:24,673
So, these custom instructions you see here

387
00:17:24,673 --> 00:17:28,230
