388
00:17:28,230 --> 00:17:32,497
AGENTS.md is immediately sent as context to the large model

389
00:17:32,497 --> 00:17:35,390
when you chat with Codex on any project.

390
00:17:35,590 --> 00:17:38,117
So, you can manually write it in here yourself.

391
00:17:38,117 --> 00:17:40,095
But personally, I prefer to just tell

392
00:17:40,095 --> 00:17:41,579
