00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:53,480
Don't directly modify.

398
00:17:53,760 --> 00:17:56,760
And save this for me in the global AGENTS.md.

399
00:17:57,190 --> 00:17:57,197
Okay, it's written. Opening 'Personalization', we see this new set of rules has indeed been added.

400
00:18:05,630 --> 00:18:09,310
So in practice, it will then follow this rule of ours.

