414
00:18:51,860 --> 00:18:54,290
Then there's project level AGENTS.md,

415
00:18:54,290 --> 00:18:58,140
whose long term memory is effective only in this project.

416
00:18:58,390 --> 00:19:00,714
We can select a project conversation,

417
00:19:00,714 --> 00:19:02,024
then open the editor

418
00:19:02,024 --> 00:19:05,300
