419
00:19:05,300 --> 00:19:05,935
an `.md` file,

420
00:19:05,935 --> 00:19:09,620
and then we can write some rules specific to this project.

421
00:19:09,820 --> 00:19:12,700
Or, of course, you can have Codex write it for you.

422
00:19:12,980 --> 00:19:14,751
My personal recommendation is,

423
00:19:14,751 --> 00:19:17,745
