00:24:19,440 --> 00:24:24,320
Beneath every AI reply, there's this button called 'Fork'.

536
00:24:24,640 --> 00:24:29,246
This means we can start a new conversation from here anytime,

537
00:24:29,246 --> 00:24:31,976
