00:26:16,416 --> 00:26:18,213
Nice! The project's background,

575
00:26:18,213 --> 00:26:21,508
all the info, rules, and file paths have been written out.

576
00:26:21,960 --> 00:26:24,894
So from now on, whether we start a new chat

