602
00:27:31,480 --> 00:27:34,640
You can install them as needed—just click the plus sign.

603
00:27:34,720 --> 00:27:37,796
So, let's head over to the 'Coding' section first,

604
00:27:37,796 --> 00:27:40,740
as plugins make deployment super convenient.

605
00:27:41,180 --> 00:27:43,549
Both Vercel and Netlify are fine.

606
00:27:43,549 --> 00:27:45,846
