00:31:57,106 --> 00:31:59,469
So if you're keen, definitely catch up.

703
00:31:59,680 --> 00:32:02,913
So, a Skill is essentially our refined

704
00:32:02,913 --> 00:32:05,011
set of reusable methods,

705
00:32:05,011 --> 00:32:06,760
workflows, and tools.

706
00:32:07,060 --> 00:32:08,876
They're basically action guides

707
00:32:08,876 --> 00:32:11,220
for the Agent to perform specific tasks.

708
00:32:11,360 --> 00:32:15,675
Now, because we've already had Codex install a meta Skill

709
00:32:15,675 --> 00:32:16,215
for us

710
00:32:16,215 --> 00:32:17,680
called 'Find Skill'...

711
00:32:17,880 --> 00:32:21,653
So, when installing or finding community Skills,

712
00:32:21,653 --> 00:32:23,487
you can just use Codex

713
00:32:23,487 --> 00:32:26,740
