724
00:32:47,980 --> 00:32:50,201
But as I said in that CC episode,

725
00:32:50,201 --> 00:32:53,368
the best Skills are those you create yourself,

726
00:32:53,368 --> 00:32:55,340
tailored for your own work.

727
00:32:55,340 --> 00:32:57,839
There are two ways to create a Skill.

728
00:32:58,080 --> 00:32:59,589
First, you can just tell Codex

729
00:32:59,589 --> 00:33:01,568
