732
00:33:05,100 --> 00:33:07,852
The other way, which we're about to demonstrate,

733
00:33:07,852 --> 00:33:10,035
is to first get the workflow running,

734
00:33:10,035 --> 00:33:12,280
and then have it turned into a Skill.

735
00:33:12,480 --> 00:33:14,775
This is also the recommended approach.

736
00:33:14,775 --> 00:33:17,734
