771
00:34:52,560 --> 00:34:55,639
So, here's the final result: and sure enough, it got sent out.

772
00:34:56,020 --> 00:34:58,500
Actually, for those of you who want to take it even further,

773
00:34:58,500 --> 00:35:00,669
